<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=yes">
    <title>AHC公会 · 电脑公告APP</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --app-bg: #0b0e14;
            --titlebar-bg: #1a1f2b;
            --titlebar-border: #2e3547;
            --card-bg: #151a24;
            --card-border: #2c3343;
            --text: #e8e6e0;
            --muted: #9aa1b0;
            --gold: #d9b86a;
            --gold-bright: #f2d28c;
            --gold-dim: #a88c4a;
            --red: #ff6161;
            --red-soft: rgba(255, 90, 90, 0.15);
            --blue: #6ea8dc;
            --shadow-app: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
            --shadow-window: 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03), 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
            --radius-window: 18px;
            --radius-card: 14px;
            --font: 'Inter', 'Segoe UI', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', system-ui, sans-serif;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            background: #06080d;
            background-image:
                radial-gradient(ellipse at 10% 20%, rgba(60, 70, 100, 0.15) 0%, transparent 55%),
                radial-gradient(ellipse at 90% 70%, rgba(140, 110, 60, 0.08) 0%, transparent 50%),
                linear-gradient(145deg, #0a0d13, #11151f);
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: var(--font);
            color: var(--text);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 1.5rem;
        }

        /* 电脑APP窗口容器 */
        .app-window {
            max-width: 1000px;
            width: 100%;
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border-radius: var(--radius-window);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-window);
            border: 1px solid var(--titlebar-border);
            overflow: hidden;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        /* 标题栏 */
        .title-bar {
            background: var(--titlebar-bg);
            padding: 0.9rem 1.5rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--titlebar-border);
            user-select: none;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .window-controls {
            display: flex;
            gap: 8px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .window-dot {
            width: 14px;
            height: 14px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgba(255,255,255,0.2), 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        .dot-red { background: #ff5f57; }
        .dot-yellow { background: #febc2e; }
        .dot-green { background: #28c840; }

        .app-title {
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 1rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.8px;
            color: #cbd0dc;
            margin-left: 6px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .app-title i {
            font-style: normal;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            filter: drop-shadow(0 0 6px rgba(200,170,80,0.5));
        }

        .title-badge {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            padding: 0.2rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: #b9b29e;
            border: 1px solid rgba(200,170,90,0.2);
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            margin-left: auto;
        }

        /* 主内容区域 */
        .app-content {
            padding: 1.8rem 2rem 2.2rem;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            overflow-y: auto;
            max-height: 85vh;
        }

        /* 临时通知横幅 */
        .notice-banner {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 80, 80, 0.08), rgba(25, 20, 22, 0.85));
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 100, 100, 0.3);
            border-radius: var(--radius-card);
            padding: 1rem 1.6rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 1rem;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
        }

        .notice-label {
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: #ffb3b6;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            letter-spacing: 0.3px;
        }

        .notice-value {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
            padding: 0.25rem 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 40px;
            color: #ffe2b0;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            border: 1px dashed rgba(255, 215, 150, 0.4);
        }

        /* 区块通用 */
        .section {
            margin-bottom: 2.2rem;
        }

        .section-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(200, 170, 100, 0.2);
            position: relative;
        }

        .section-header::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -1px;
            left: 0;
            width: 48px;
            height: 2px;
            background: var(--gold);
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(220, 180, 100, 0.5);
        }

        .section-icon {
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.4));
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 1.45rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            color: #f0e5cc;
        }

        /* 信息卡片 */
        .info-panel {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
            border-radius: var(--radius-card);
            padding: 1.3rem 1.6rem;
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 2.5rem;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .info-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: baseline;
            gap: 12px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .info-label {
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: var(--muted);
        }

        .info-value {
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: #fff;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            padding: 0.15rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 24px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
        }

        .ip-value {
            background: rgba(210, 175, 100, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(210, 175, 100, 0.35);
            color: var(--gold-bright);
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.8px;
        }

        /* 规则列表 */
        .rule-list {
            list-style: none;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.55rem;
        }

        .rule-list li {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 0.65rem 1.2rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 0.8rem;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
            box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
        }

        .rule-list li:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
            border-color: rgba(210, 175, 100, 0.35);
            transform: translateX(3px);
        }

        .rule-list li::before {
            content: "◆";
            color: var(--gold);
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            margin-top: 0.2rem;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(200,160,80,0.5);
        }

        /* 建筑网格 */
        .building-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 0.7rem;
        }

        .building-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 0.7rem 1rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.7rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }

        .building-card:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border-color: rgba(210, 175, 100, 0.4);
            box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(200,160,80,0.1);
        }

        .building-icon {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            filter: drop-shadow(0 0 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.5));
        }

        /* 底部 */
        .footer-spirit {
            margin-top: 2.5rem;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            color: #f3e2b8;
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(35, 30, 20, 0.8), rgba(20, 22, 30, 0.9));
            padding: 1rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 40px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(210, 175, 100, 0.3);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        }

        .update-tag {
            text-align: right;
            margin-top: 0.8rem;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #7e8494;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        /* 滚动条美化 */
        .app-content::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 8px;
        }
        .app-content::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: #10151f;
            border-radius: 20px;
        }
        .app-content::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: #2e3547;
            border-radius: 20px;
        }
        .app-content::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
            background: #3e465c;
        }

        @media (max-width: 650px) {
            body { padding: 0.6rem; }
            .app-content { padding: 1.2rem 1rem; }
            .section-title { font-size: 1.25rem; }
            .info-panel { flex-direction: column; gap: 0.8rem; }
            .building-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(150px, 1fr)); }
            .notice-banner { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
            .title-badge { margin-left: 0; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="app-window">
        <!-- 模拟APP标题栏 -->
        <div class="title-bar">
            <div class="window-controls">
                <span class="window-dot dot-red"></span>
                <span class="window-dot dot-yellow"></span>
                <span class="window-dot dot-green"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="app-title">
                <i>🛡️</i> AHC公会公告中心
            </div>
            <span class="title-badge">📋 电脑版 · v2.0</span>
        </div>

        <!-- APP 内容区域 -->
        <div class="app-content">
            <!-- 📌 重要临时通知 -->
            <div class="notice-banner">
                <div class="notice-label">📌 重要临时通知</div>
                <div class="notice-value">无</div>
            </div>

            <!-- 📢 服务器信息 -->
            <div class="section">
                <div class="section-header">
                    <span class="section-icon">📢</span>
                    <span class="section-title">服务器信息</span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-panel">
                    <div class="info-item">
                        <span class="info-label">服务器IP</span>
                        <span class="info-value ip-value">mcgame.me</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="info-item">
                        <span class="info-label">版本</span>
                        <span class="info-value">Minecraft JAVA 26.1.2 Fabric</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- ⚠️ 进服须知 -->
            <div class="section">
                <div class="section-header">
                    <span class="section-icon">⚠️</span>
                    <span class="section-title">进服须知</span>
                </div>
                <ul class="rule-list">
                    <li>客户端必须安装 <strong>Fabric加载器</strong>，版本 <strong>0.19.3</strong></li>
                    <li>建议安装基础优化模组，减少卡顿崩溃</li>
                    <li>禁止客户端安装破坏平衡的作弊类模组</li>
                    <li>遇到崩溃、BUG请及时向管理反馈</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- 🏗️ 公会建筑 -->
            <div class="section">
                <div class="section-header">
                    <span class="section-icon">🏗️</span>
                    <span class="section-title">公会建筑</span>
                </div>
                <div class="building-grid">
                    <div class="building-card"><span class="building-icon">🌑</span> 小黑塔：xht</div>
                    <div class="building-card"><span class="building-icon">🔥</span> 烈焰人农场：zyr</div>
                    <div class="building-card"><span class="building-icon">🐷</span> 猪人塔：zhurenta</div>
                    <div class="building-card"><span class="building-icon">🏹</span> 掠夺塔：xjt</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 📜 公会规则 -->
            <div class="section">
                <div class="section-header">
                    <span class="section-icon">📜</span>
                    <span class="section-title">公会规则</span>
                </div>
                <ul class="rule-list">
                    <li>加入公会可以自由游玩，但禁止熊行为，否则管理会被追责</li>
                    <li>在公会领地建造、改动设施，需要提前告知管理</li>
                    <li>遇到问题直接找管理，管理除下午以外基本在线；不咨询就散播小团体言论不予认可</li>
                    <li>大量取用物资必须提前和管理说明</li>
                    <li>外来朋友可以临时游玩，请勿长期逗留干扰公会</li>
                    <li>连续15天未上线将会被踢出，学业、工作特殊情况提前报备除外</li>
                    <li>每周上交150金币作为公会维护经费，特殊情况可报备，请勿长期拖欠</li>
                    <li>不主动与其他公会发生冲突，不参与外部凑热闹引战</li>
                    <li>禁止使用作弊模组，一经发现重罚并直接踢出公会</li>
                    <li>成功招入一名新公会成员，奖励200金币；小号刷入会不计奖励</li>
                    <li>禁止私自挪用、拆改公会公共机器与储物物资，公会领地禁止恶意PVP坑害队友</li>
                    <li>无意损坏公会公共设施请及时上报，隐瞒不报造成损失将予以处罚</li>
                    <li>成员发生矛盾交由管理调解，禁止私下到处挑起矛盾</li>
                    <li>主动退会之后，不再享有公会全部公共资源使用权限</li>
                    <li>公会账号禁止转借他人，转借账号产生的违规行为由账号本人负责</li>
                    <li>全体成员必须遵守以上全部公会条例</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- ✨ 公会精神 -->
            <div class="footer-spirit">
                ✨ AHC公会｜同心协作，共建生存世界 ✨
            </div>
            <div class="update-tag">
                公告更新：2026‑08‑20
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
